{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/86fa5c085fdb267fa16b2c1b6d2dd607.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=188 /></span>Fallen Seeds II continues the thrilling sci-fi adventure of Evod and his companions Ada, Lily, Sif, Ophelia, and Kaya. This second part  delves deeper into the mysteries of Ulthar and brings the story to its climax. Players can either pick up where they left off in the first part or start directly from the second part with a quick recap of previous events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/caead790e5587d05dc532c4cfca06311.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Evod as he navigates the political intrigues and hidden dangers of Ulthar. The Anomalous Zone, a mysterious and perilous area, remains a focal point of the conflict, with powerful Galactic forces converging on its secrets. Your choices will continue to shape the story, determining alliances, enmities, and the fate of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/5278166914040e3d07af2fa56f4b507a.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative remains rich and multifaceted, combining humor, romance, and drama against a backdrop of interstellar conflict. Hand-animated cutscenes and vivid art bring the world to life, ensuring an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/db7ccd0915dfa1ba60e2d5b8d2002d3a.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple routes and endings, expanding on the choices made in the first part. With new characters, locations, and music, Fallen Seeds II promises an engaging continuation of the saga.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3109240?t=1758892925","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758892925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758892925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758892925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/86fa5c085fdb267fa16b2c1b6d2dd607.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=188 /></span>Fallen Seeds II continues the thrilling sci-fi adventure of Evod and his companions Ada, Lily, Sif, Ophelia, and Kaya. This second part  delves deeper into the mysteries of Ulthar and brings the story to its climax. Players can either pick up where they left off in the first part or start directly from the second part with a quick recap of previous events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/caead790e5587d05dc532c4cfca06311.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Evod as he navigates the political intrigues and hidden dangers of Ulthar. The Anomalous Zone, a mysterious and perilous area, remains a focal point of the conflict, with powerful Galactic forces converging on its secrets. Your choices will continue to shape the story, determining alliances, enmities, and the fate of the characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/5278166914040e3d07af2fa56f4b507a.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The narrative remains rich and multifaceted, combining humor, romance, and drama against a backdrop of interstellar conflict. Hand-animated cutscenes and vivid art bring the world to life, ensuring an immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/extras/db7ccd0915dfa1ba60e2d5b8d2002d3a.avif?t=1758892925\" width=600 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple routes and endings, expanding on the choices made in the first part. With new characters, locations, and music, Fallen Seeds II promises an engaging continuation of the saga.</p>","developers":["KPD"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109240/header.jpg?t=1758892925","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3109240/749069/9af0e2350f0ce1e38971e24f9e90747566a92d0b/1750871596/dash_av1.mpd?t=1725127980","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3109240/749069/9af0e2350f0ce1e38971e24f9e90747566a92d0b/1750871596/dash_h264.mpd?t=1725127980","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3109240/749069/9af